/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:8802:        "description": "Describe where you want to go and what you want to do, and skip the search. Get a tailored selection of trails from Wikiloc's 77 million authentic trails, shared by 20 million outdoor enthusiasts worldwide.\n\nAsk for hiking routes near your destination, cycling paths that match your fitness level, or hidden trails locals love. Explore interactive trail maps with waypoints marking peaks, waterfalls, viewpoints, and other highlights mapped by the Wikiloc community. \n\nSee over 140 million photos taken along the trails so you know what awaits before you plan your next adventure.\n\nTry asking:\n\n- \"Find me family-friendly trails in Spain\"\n- \"Show me mountain bike routes in the Alps around 20km\"\n- \"I'm visiting Italy next week. Find me 3 beautiful hikes near the Dolomites with lake views\"\n- \"I want to see the great cliffs of Ireland. Recommend me some hikes\"\n- \"Show me some stunning hikes ideal for a weekend in California\"",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:8819:          "long_description": "Describe where you want to go and what you want to do, and skip the search. Get a tailored selection of trails from Wikiloc's 77 million authentic trails, shared by 20 million outdoor enthusiasts worldwide.\n\nAsk for hiking routes near your destination, cycling paths that match your fitness level, or hidden trails locals love. Explore interactive trail maps with waypoints marking peaks, waterfalls, viewpoints, and other highlights mapped by the Wikiloc community. \n\nSee over 140 million photos taken along the trails so you know what awaits before you plan your next adventure.\n\nTry asking:\n\n- \"Find me family-friendly trails in Spain\"\n- \"Show me mountain bike routes in the Alps around 20km\"\n- \"I'm visiting Italy next week. Find me 3 beautiful hikes near the Dolomites with lake views\"\n- \"I want to see the great cliffs of Ireland. Recommend me some hikes\"\n- \"Show me some stunning hikes ideal for a weekend in California\"",
