/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:20481:        "description": "Upwork makes it easy to turn a simple conversation into real work, right from ChatGPT. Describe what you need and instantly get matched with expert talent from Upwork or generate a job post in seconds. Then, move seamlessly to Upwork to hire quickly and get started.\n\nTry asking things like:\n* I'm looking for a freelance web developer\n* Help me draft a job post for an AI engineering project\n* I want to hire a freelancer to build my website",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:20498:          "long_description": "Upwork makes it easy to turn a simple conversation into real work, right from ChatGPT. Describe what you need and instantly get matched with expert talent from Upwork or generate a job post in seconds. Then, move seamlessly to Upwork to hire quickly and get started.\n\nTry asking things like:\n* I'm looking for a freelance web developer\n* Help me draft a job post for an AI engineering project\n* I want to hire a freelancer to build my website",
