/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:58893:        "description": "SpaceCloud Global helps you find and book rental spaces internationally — meeting rooms, photo and video studios, coworking offices, and event venues. Describe what you need in natural language\n  (location, date, time, capacity), and SpaceCloud Global returns a ranked list of matching spaces with photos, pricing, amenities, and direct booking links on spacecloud.city. Currently available\n   in the United Kingdom and Ireland, with additional countries being added on an ongoing basis.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:58910:          "long_description": "SpaceCloud Global helps you find and book rental spaces internationally — meeting rooms, photo and video studios, coworking offices, and event venues. Describe what you need in natural language\n  (location, date, time, capacity), and SpaceCloud Global returns a ranked list of matching spaces with photos, pricing, amenities, and direct booking links on spacecloud.city. Currently available\n   in the United Kingdom and Ireland, with additional countries being added on an ongoing basis.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:62337:        "description": "TaxHeaven gives self-employed workers, freelancers, sole traders, and landlords instant UK tax answers using HMRC-published rates, right inside ChatGPT.\n\n8 tools cover the full self-employed tax journey:\n• Calculate income tax, National Insurance, and take-home pay (England and Scotland)\n• Check if Making Tax Digital (MTD) applies to you and when it starts\n• See all your tax deadlines with countdown timers\n• Work out your payments on account and how much to save monthly\n• Add or remove VAT, compare the Flat Rate Scheme, check registration thresholds\n• Find out if an expense is tax-deductible under HMRC rules\n• Calculate capital allowances on business equipment and vehicles\n• Scan receipts and categorise them for your tax return\n\nAll calculations use official HMRC rates for 2024-25 through 2026-27. No sign-up required, no data stored, MTD compliance completely free from HMRC-recognised software.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:62354:          "long_description": "TaxHeaven gives self-employed workers, freelancers, sole traders, and landlords instant UK tax answers using HMRC-published rates, right inside ChatGPT.\n\n8 tools cover the full self-employed tax journey:\n• Calculate income tax, National Insurance, and take-home pay (England and Scotland)\n• Check if Making Tax Digital (MTD) applies to you and when it starts\n• See all your tax deadlines with countdown timers\n• Work out your payments on account and how much to save monthly\n• Add or remove VAT, compare the Flat Rate Scheme, check registration thresholds\n• Find out if an expense is tax-deductible under HMRC rules\n• Calculate capital allowances on business equipment and vehicles\n• Scan receipts and categorise them for your tax return\n\nAll calculations use official HMRC rates for 2024-25 through 2026-27. No sign-up required, no data stored, MTD compliance completely free from HMRC-recognised software.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:62365:            "I'm a freelancer earning £55,000 a year. Do I need to use Making Tax Digita",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:81777:        "description": "Asbie is an AI-powered CRM companion that brings your customer and business data directly into ChatGPT.\n\nUse natural language to search contacts, companies, deals, tasks, and notes from your Asbie workspace. Stay on top of customer relationships, track sales opportunities, and manage daily activities without switching between multiple applications.\n\nDesigned for freelancers, consultants, sales professionals, educators, small businesses, and growing teams who want a simpler and more efficient way to manage customer relationships.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:81794:          "long_description": "Asbie is an AI-powered CRM companion that brings your customer and business data directly into ChatGPT.\n\nUse natural language to search contacts, companies, deals, tasks, and notes from your Asbie workspace. Stay on top of customer relationships, track sales opportunities, and manage daily activities without switching between multiple applications.\n\nDesigned for freelancers, consultants, sales professionals, educators, small businesses, and growing teams who want a simpler and more efficient way to manage customer relationships.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:84218:        "description": "A language-learning diary app that helps you study a foreign language by writing your daily journal in it — Blossom.\nWrite in 50+ languages including English, Japanese, Chinese, Korean and more, and improve your foreign-language skills every day.\n\nWrite as much as you can in the foreign-languages. The AI assistant provides real-time corrections with perfect grammar.\nFeeling hesitant to start writing in a foreign language? It’s perfectly fine to mix in your native language. The AI engine automatically translates it into natural, context-appropriate foreign-language sentences.\n\nEven rough drafts are polished smoothly, the “Blossom Editor” helps you write in any language with ease.\nHundreds of thousands of foreign-language journal entries are updated daily on Blossom.\n\nBlossom is the world’s first and largest AI language-learning platform that integrates journaling with AI, allowing daily diary writing to naturally turn into language learning.\nWith just one sentence a day, you can build a habit that covers all core language skills — writing, speaking, listening, and reading.\n\nWith a single global journal written together with AI each day, you get vocabulary study, shadowing, AI tutor conversations, and more. Every language learning feature made possible through journaling.\n\nJoin global Blossom users and record and share your daily life in a foreign language.\n\n✨ AI Tools\n• Blossom AI: Ask the AI anything about language learning.\n• Blossom Editor: An AI-powered writing editor with real-time feedback and grammar correction.\n\n🎯 Learning Features\n• Diary Voca: Automatically creates vocabulary lists from your journal and helps you learn words and sentences through fun games.\n• Diary Speak: Improve listening and pronunciation through shadowing practice using your own journal.\n• Diary Inspector: Continue daily learning with correction history and follow-up questions.\n• Proofreading: Skilled tutors provide professional corrections within 24 hours.\n• Level Test: Track your proficiency level based on your journal entries.\n\n🌍 Global Community\n• Shared Diaries: Decorate your journal with stickers and share your daily life with global friends around the world.\n• Language Exchange: Chat with global users in real-time and make foreign friends naturally.\n• Blossom Points: Earn points through community activities and exchange them for real cash.\n• Blossom World Travel: Explore new cultures and everyday lives through journals written by users worldwide.\n\n🪄 Utility / Tools\n• Blossom Translate: A brand new translator that supports “AI agentic communication” for travel, customer support, and conversations with foreign friends.\n• Blossom Diary: You can use Blossom like a regular diary by setting learning language to your native language. (All decoration and community features remain available!)\n\n🌐 Learning Languages\nEnglish, Korean, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Vietnamese, Thai, Indonesian, Malay, Khmer, Burmese, Turkish, Kazakh, Russian, Ukrainian, Mongolian, Spanish, Portuguese, Hindi, Arabic, French, German, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Greek, Romanian, Hungarian, Czech, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, Finnish, Bulgarian, Croatian, Slovak, Slovenian, Lithuanian, Latvian, Estonian, Icelandic, Irish, Maltese, Luxembourgish, Serbian, Catalan, Albanian, Belarusian, Bosnian, Galician, Macedonian, Basque\n\n🌸 Blossom\nBlossom (Blossom Diary) began as an English Diary and has grown into the world’s first and largest platform that integrates journaling and language learning through AI.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:84235:          "long_description": "A language-learning diary app that helps you study a foreign language by writing your daily journal in it — Blossom.\nWrite in 50+ languages including English, Japanese, Chinese, Korean and more, and improve your foreign-language skills every day.\n\nWrite as much as you can in the foreign-languages. The AI assistant provides real-time corrections with perfect grammar.\nFeeling hesitant to start writing in a foreign language? It’s perfectly fine to mix in your native language. The AI engine automatically translates it into natural, context-appropriate foreign-language sentences.\n\nEven rough drafts are polished smoothly, the “Blossom Editor” helps you write in any language with ease.\nHundreds of thousands of foreign-language journal entries are updated daily on Blossom.\n\nBlossom is the world’s first and largest AI language-learning platform that integrates journaling with AI, allowing daily diary writing to naturally turn into language learning.\nWith just one sentence a day, you can build a habit that covers all core language skills — writing, speaking, listening, and reading.\n\nWith a single global journal written together with AI each day, you get vocabulary study, shadowing, AI tutor conversations, and more. Every language learning feature made possible through journaling.\n\nJoin global Blossom users and record and share your daily life in a foreign language.\n\n✨ AI Tools\n• Blossom AI: Ask the AI anything about language learning.\n• Blossom Editor: An AI-powered writing editor with real-time feedback and grammar correction.\n\n🎯 Learning Features\n• Diary Voca: Automatically creates vocabulary lists from your journal and helps you learn words and sentences through fun games.\n• Diary Speak: Improve listening and pronunciation through shadowing practice using your own journal.\n• Diary Inspector: Continue daily learning with correction history and follow-up questions.\n• Proofreading: Skilled tutors provide professional corrections within 24 hours.\n• Level Test: Track your proficiency level based on your journal entries.\n\n🌍 Global Community\n• Shared Diaries: Decorate your journal with stickers and share your daily life with global friends around the world.\n• Language Exchange: Chat with global users in real-time and make foreign friends naturally.\n• Blossom Points: Earn points through community activities and exchange them for real cash.\n• Blossom World Travel: Explore new cultures and everyday lives through journals written by users worldwide.\n\n🪄 Utility / Tools\n• Blossom Translate: A brand new translator that supports “AI agentic communication” for travel, customer support, and conversations with foreign friends.\n• Blossom Diary: You can use Blossom like a regular diary by setting learning language to your native language. (All decoration and community features remain available!)\n\n🌐 Learning Languages\nEnglish, Korean, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Vietnamese, Thai, Indonesian, Malay, Khmer, Burmese, Turkish, Kazakh, Russian, Ukrainian, Mongolian, Spanish, Portuguese, Hindi, Arabic, French, German, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Greek, Romanian, Hungarian, Czech, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, Finnish, Bulgarian, Croatian, Slovak, Slovenian, Lithuanian, Latvian, Estonian, Icelandic, Irish, Maltese, Luxembourgish, Serbian, Catalan, Albanian, Belarusian, Bosnian, Galician, Macedonian, Basque\n\n🌸 Blossom\nBlossom (Blossom Diary) began as an English Diary and has grown into the world’s first and largest platform that integrates journaling and language learning through AI.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:97286:        "description": "ExpenseBot turns ChatGPT into a full expense-management workflow for freelancers, accountants, real-estate agents, and small business owners.\n\nDrop a receipt photo or PDF in chat and AI extracts vendor, amount, date, tax, and category, then writes the row to your Google Sheet within 30 seconds. Ask \"how much did I spend on travel last quarter, broken down by client\" and get a per-tag P&L with revenue, cost, profit, and margin. Build a Q1 expense report and have ChatGPT email it to your accountant.\n\nTools fall into scope-gated categories the user explicitly approves during the OAuth consent flow: read expenses, submit expenses (photos, PDFs, cash, mileage, income), scan Gmail for missed receipts, read reports, write reports, and run compliance and tax-deductibility checks.\n\nWhile ExpenseBot can scan Gmail (with the user's explicit OAuth consent), Gmail is one of many input paths. The app's primary value is the analytics, reporting, and tax tooling that operates on the user's own categorized expense data.\n\nThe ChatGPT app does not sell anything and processes no payment. It manages the user's own expense data. An ExpenseBot account is required; new users can create one for free at expensebot.ai before connecting.\n\nOAuth 2.1 + PKCE S256 + Dynamic Client Registration. CASA Tier 2 certified.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:97303:          "long_description": "ExpenseBot turns ChatGPT into a full expense-management workflow for freelancers, accountants, real-estate agents, and small business owners.\n\nDrop a receipt photo or PDF in chat and AI extracts vendor, amount, date, tax, and category, then writes the row to your Google Sheet within 30 seconds. Ask \"how much did I spend on travel last quarter, broken down by client\" and get a per-tag P&L with revenue, cost, profit, and margin. Build a Q1 expense report and have ChatGPT email it to your accountant.\n\nTools fall into scope-gated categories the user explicitly approves during the OAuth consent flow: read expenses, submit expenses (photos, PDFs, cash, mileage, income), scan Gmail for missed receipts, read reports, write reports, and run compliance and tax-deductibility checks.\n\nWhile ExpenseBot can scan Gmail (with the user's explicit OAuth consent), Gmail is one of many input paths. The app's primary value is the analytics, reporting, and tax tooling that operates on the user's own categorized expense data.\n\nThe ChatGPT app does not sell anything and processes no payment. It manages the user's own expense data. An ExpenseBot account is required; new users can create one for free at expensebot.ai before connecting.\n\nOAuth 2.1 + PKCE S256 + Dynamic Client Registration. CASA Tier 2 certified.",
/home/agent/.audit-supervisor.xAakfB/codex-home/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/315d16afbba55c16.json:102918:        "description": "GST Invoice Maker creates GST-compliant bills for Indian shops, restaurants, kiranas, and freelancers. Ask for a bill in plain language and get computed totals plus a link that opens the bill fully filled in — ready to print or save as PDF. Also provides ready-made downloadable bill format PDFs and a GST reference guide (required invoice fields, rate slabs). Free, no account needed, and bill data is processed in-memory — never stored.",
